-focused computational pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Microbiology","Bioinformatics + Python","M.Sc Bioinformatics/Computational Biology","Computational Microbiology Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"The key is to move beyond basic laboratory work and build a combination of microbiology expertise, molecular techniques, quality systems, data analysis and computational biology. This gives the student flexibility across pharmaceuticals, diagnostics, biotechnology, food, environmental science and research."}]}]}